[
  {
    "id": 2002004110010,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふぅ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040020010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00021",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様。水、持ってきたぞ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』優勝はすごい影響だな\r\n仕事のオファーが殺到してるぞ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "雑誌の表紙に、取材に歌番組……大忙しだ！\r\n……って、どうした？　灯織？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ……すみません\r\n少しぼんやりしてました",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうした？　もしかして疲れてるのか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、そうではなくて……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……中学の頃に見たアイドルを思い出したんです\r\nあの人も、こんな風だったのかな、と思って",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織がアイドルになったきっかけだっていう人か",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。昔の私はただ見ていただけでしたが……\r\n少しは近づけたかも、って気がするんです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "理想には、まだまだ遠いですが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そういえば、まだ聞かせてもらってなかったな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "何かを好きになりたいと言っていたが\r\n今はどうだ？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今は……\r\nたくさんのものを好きになれました",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "事務所の仲間と、応援してくれるファンの皆さん\r\nそれに応えられるようにステージに立つこと……",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……そして、プロデューサーのこと",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……！？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "off"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "あ、いや、これはその……！　恋愛感情とかではなく\r\n信頼できるパートナーとして、という意味です",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、もちろんわかってるよ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織に信頼してもらえて嬉しいし\r\nなにより、灯織の好きなものが見つかってよかった",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "正直……何かを好きになれるなんて、思わなかったです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "昔の私ひとりだったら、きっとあのままでしたが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、そんな私をプロデューサーが変えてくれました",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "本当に、ありがとうございます……！",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺は手助けしただけだよ\r\n変われたのは、灯織自身の努力だ",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから……\r\nもっと、自分のことを好きになってもいいんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今、少しずつ……自分を\r\n好きになれてるのが、わかるんです",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その瞬間が、とても幸せに感じられて――",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "きっと最初から、私は自分のことを\r\n好きになりたかったんだなって、気付けました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサーと一緒なら\r\nもっと自分のことを好きになれると思うんです",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002004110240,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、これからもどうか\r\n私のことをよろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200411/2002004110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……！　もちろんだ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]